Read and follow the repository-root `AGENTS.md` A-share data workflow.

For market-data requests, find the repository root first and run the shared
`tools/stock_query.py` script with a Python 3.11+ project interpreter. Do not
assume the active terminal is in the repository and do not invent prices or
claim a lookup succeeded before inspecting command output.
